# NOTE: result JSON files are evaluation EVIDENCE in this repo, not scratch
# output -- they are intentionally tracked under evaluation/, benchmarks/,
# and paper/. Do not add a broad *_result*.json / result.json ignore rule
# here again; a previous version of this pattern silently blocked the
# real-world evaluation's v5-v9 scan results and multiple benchmark result
# files from ever being committed, and was only caught by an explicit
# repo audit. If you need to ignore a specific scratch/local-only result
# file, ignore it by its exact full path, not a wildcard.
.venv/
